          {
            "id": 2764507,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Now let me give you some idea of the layout of the farm. The building where you bought your tickets is the new barn immediately to your right, and we're now at the beginning of the main path to the farmland. And, of course, the car park is on your left. The scarecrow you can see in the car park in the corner beside the main path is a traditional figure for keeping the birds away from crops. But our scarecrow is a permanent sculpture.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2764508,
                "level": 2,
